---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <p>
    GlassesBeGone is a manually curated archive of news coverage of smart-glasses bans.
    Spot a ban that's missing? Add an entry as a Markdown file and open a pull request at <a href="https://github.com/fweidner/GlassesBeGone/">https://github.com/fweidner/GlassesBeGone/"</a>!
  </p>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .site-footer p {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
</style>
